  "03 不止是玩具|是孩子藏在身边的情绪树洞很多家长都会问:超级球球,到底和普通玩具有什么不一样?答案很简单:它不会敷衍孩子,更不会否定孩子。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
  "在孩子开心的时候,它会热情回应、陪孩子分享喜悦;在孩子委屈难过、闹小情绪的时候,它会耐心倾听、温柔共情,不指责、不说教。它是专属孩子的秘密树洞:心里的小秘密、上学的小烦恼、成长的小困惑,不愿和爸妈说的话,都可以放心讲给球球听。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
  "同时搭配专属家长APP,孩子的情绪变化、成长动态家长可清晰掌握,既给孩子独立的情绪空间,也让家长全程安心可控。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
