  "TECH MUSE 现场直击:超级球球,用软乎乎的温度对话未来": "TECH MUSE Spotlight: Chio Chio Talks to the Future with Soft Warmth",
  "一场关于未来的对话,从一只软乎乎的球球开始2026年5月21日,由ROBOHUB主办的「TECH MUSE 创见未来·“双创” 社区进化论」主题活动在深圳文化创意园启幕。在充满未来感的...": "TECH MUSE Spotlight: Chio Chio Talks to the Future with Soft Warmth. This update follows Super YouAI’s ongoing journey in AI companionship, child growth, and emotionally warm hardware.",
  "一场关于未来的对话,从一只软乎乎的球球开始2026年5月21日,由ROBOHUB主办的「TECH MUSE 创见未来·“双创” 社区进化论」主题活动在深圳文化创意园启幕。在充满未来感的展厅里,有一抹鲜亮的绿和一团柔软的白,吸引了所有目光。": "This section captures Chio Chio’s appearance at events and exhibitions, where the team met families, partners, media, and professional audiences while sharing its vision for emotionally warm AI hardware.",
  "它们是,超级球球!这只软萌的 AI 儿童成长陪伴机器人,带着它对孩子情绪的深度理解,第一次走进了这场关于未来的盛会。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
  "它不只是玩具,更是懂孩子的 “情绪树洞”很多时候,孩子的小情绪像一颗未被理解的种子,需要被看见、被倾听。超级球球,就是为此而生的,专为 5-12 岁孩子设计,搭载自研的有爱 AI 心理模型,它能精准识别孩子的情绪,像一个温柔的树洞,陪伴他们疏解情绪、表达自我。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
  "软乎乎的仿生毛绒触感,搭配灵动的星空眼眸,每一次触碰,它都会用温柔的方式回应。": "This section is part of “TECH MUSE Spotlight: Chio Chio Talks to the Future with Soft Warmth,” documenting Super YouAI’s ongoing exploration of warm AI companionship, child growth, and emotionally intelligent hardware.",
  "当孩子的世界里,多了一个永远耐心、永远正向的伙伴,成长的烦恼,也有了出口。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
