  "AI Agent 2025大赛 是由中国人工智能学会主办的全球顶级人工智能开发者竞赛,聚焦AIAgent技术应用与产业落地。目前,已有世界各地的1000多支顶尖AI团队报名参加。": "This section is part of “Chio Chio Advances to the AI Agent 2025 Offline Semifinals and Wins the Most Human Warmth Award,” documenting Super YouAI’s ongoing exploration of warm AI companionship, child growth, and emotionally intelligent hardware.",
