  "“超级球球”走进宜城市青年教师心理素养培训班": "Chio Chio Joins a Mental-Literacy Training Program for Young Teachers in Yicheng",
  "当前,校园心理健康问题不容忽视,无论教师还是学生的心理健康状态,都关系到家庭幸福与社会未来。“超级球球”作为具有情绪疗愈功能的AI陪伴机器人,引发了青年教师们的强烈兴趣。": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
  "郭凯燕博士说:“青年教师们朝气蓬勃、兴趣满满,是AI教育时代的生力军。他们在体验‘超级球球’之后,给了我很多积极的反馈,我们对球球未来的市场前景更有信心了。”": "This section focuses on children and families. Chio Chio is designed to accompany real growth moments, helping children practice expression, resilience, focus, and kinder communication in daily life.",
