  "-3-我们团队的创始人Vivian,是一位在教育科技领域深耕了15年的连续创业者。但她还有一个身份,是有着22年心理公益服务经验的志愿者。": "This section follows Super YouAI’s public-interest work, exploring how warm AI companionship can support children and people who need more patient, accessible emotional care.",
  "刚加入团队时,我和她做了一次3小时的深入访谈,其中一个问题是:为什么你会坚持做这么多年的心理公益服务?有什么特别的经历吗?": "This section follows Super YouAI’s public-interest work, exploring how warm AI companionship can support children and people who need more patient, accessible emotional care.",
  "Vivian说:“确实有。”然后,她讲出了那件始终无法忘怀的事:“2003年那会儿,我刚上大学,初次接触到心理义工的工作,只要有空,周末就会去陪伴养老院的老人。": "This section describes how Chio Chio entered elder-care and community-service settings, using gentle AI companionship to bring more warmth, conversation, and emotional support into everyday care.",
  "母亲节那天,我陪伴的一位70多岁的老太太,一大早就起来,特意穿上很体面的衣服,让护工帮忙把自己收拾得干干净净,等待着子女来探望。": "This section explains Super YouAI’s approach to emotional companionship: combining psychology, AI, IoT hardware, and long-term interaction so support feels warm, timely, and usable in real life.",
  "一开始,我们陪她在室内坐着,到了下午四五点,她就让人把自己推到门口去等。可是,子女一直没有出现。": "The conversation returns to a simple belief: an AI companion should not replace human care, but make warm, patient, and professional support easier to reach.",
  "当时我坐在门口陪她等,她开始哭起来,我看着她也非常难受,心想下个周末要专门过来看她。但就在三四天之后,她就走了。”": "The conversation returns to a simple belief: an AI companion should not replace human care, but make warm, patient, and professional support easier to reach.",
  "讲到这,Vivian哭了,她红着眼睛说:": "The conversation returns to a simple belief: an AI companion should not replace human care, but make warm, patient, and professional support easier to reach.",
  "“这件事对我的冲击非常大。因为老人并没有严重的基础病。它让我看到情绪健康竟然能对一个人产生如此巨大的影响。从那时起,我就决定,一定要在人们最无助的时候伸出手来陪伴他不止Vivian,这也是我们这群人,聚在一起创业的原因:见过、听过很多情绪或心理问题导致的悲剧,我们想要做点什么,来改变这一状况。我们想要帮助更多人摆脱情绪困扰,不再为孤独、压力、抑郁、焦虑所苦。": "This section describes how Chio Chio entered elder-care and community-service settings, using gentle AI companionship to bring more warmth, conversation, and emotional support into everyday care.",
