  "WAIC2026相约上海！超级球球将亮相上海世界人工智能大会": "WAIC 2026 in Shanghai: Chio Chio Will Appear at the World Artificial Intelligence Conference",
  "WAIC2026相约上海!超级球球将亮相上海世界人工智能大会": "WAIC 2026 in Shanghai: Chio Chio Will Appear at the World Artificial Intelligence Conference",
  "国际残奥委会主席安德鲁・帕森斯到访融爱中心，盛赞超级球球以AI守护特殊儿童心灵成长": "IPC President Andrew Parsons Visits Rongai Center and Praises Chio Chio's AI Support for Children with Special Needs",
  "国际残奥委会主席安德鲁・帕森斯到访融爱中心,盛赞超级球球以AI守护特殊儿童心灵成长": "IPC President Andrew Parsons Visits Rongai Center and Praises Chio Chio's AI Support for Children with Special Needs",
  "超级球球将亮相2026世界人工智能大会WAIC，欢迎各界伙伴到场体验AI情感交互产品。": "Chio Chio will appear at WAIC 2026, inviting partners to experience AI emotional interaction on site.",
  "国际残奥委会主席安德鲁・帕森斯到访融爱中心，体验超级球球AI陪伴产品。": "IPC President Andrew Parsons visited Rongai Center and experienced Chio Chio's AI companion product."
